

# Probe bundles. `frontend/scratchpad/probe_*.mjs` each bundle the app with esbuild's
# Node API into a temp CommonJS file next to themselves before requiring it. Six of them
# were committed by accident on 10 Sep 2026 — 355k lines of generated output in one
# commit — because the probes did not clean up and nothing here stopped them. The probes
# now delete their own file; this is the second line of defence.
frontend/scratchpad/.*.cjs

# Probe screenshots. `shoot_dean.mjs` writes PNGs and standalone HTML here; they are
# regenerable output, not source.
frontend/scratchpad/shots/
